<title>USA: Microdyne names Jalbert as President/CEO.</title>
<headline>Microdyne names Jalbert as President/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microdyne Corp said it named Michael Jalbert as its president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Jalbert succeeds Philip Cunningham, who will remain as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Previously, Jalbert was the president and chief executive officer of IDB Mobile Communications, a satellite service communications provider.</p>
<p>Microdyne manufactures telemetry receivers, adapter cards, hubs, and switches and provides support staff for telephone technical support centers.</p>
